---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, OWNER_NAME } from '../consts';

const title = 'About Me';
const description = 'Meet the person behind Cleaning by Cassi and learn how experience, heart, and hard work shaped the business.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={title} description={description} image="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />

    <main class="about-page">
      <section class="about-hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">The Person Behind the Clean ✨</p>
          <h1>Hi, I'm {OWNER_NAME}.</h1>
          <p>I'm the owner and the person behind {SITE_TITLE} — and I genuinely love helping people feel better in their homes.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/quote" class="primary-button">Get a Free Quote →</a>
            <a href="/services" class="secondary-button">Explore Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-photo-wrap">
          <img src="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg" alt={`${OWNER_NAME}, owner of Cleaning by Cassi`} class="hero-photo" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
          <div class="photo-note">💗 Locally owned & personally cared for</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="story-section">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">My Story</p><h2>Cleaning has always been a part of my life.</h2></div>
        <div class="story-grid">
          <div class="story-card"><span class="story-number">01</span><p>I grew up watching my mom build and run her own cleaning business, and I spent my summers helping her. Without realizing it at the time, those experiences gave me the foundation for what would eventually become my own business.</p></div>
          <div class="story-card"><span class="story-number">02</span><p>After my mom retired, I spent two years working for two different cleaning companies. I learned a lot about the industry, but eventually realized I wanted to take that experience and create something of my own.</p></div>
          <div class="story-card highlight-card"><span class="story-number">03</span><p><strong>In July 2025, I took the leap and started {SITE_TITLE}.</strong></p><p>A dream turned into something real. ✨</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="split-section soft-green">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Why Cleaning?</p><h2>I genuinely love what I do.</h2></div>
        <div class="copy-block"><p>There's something incredibly satisfying — and honestly, relaxing — about taking a space that needs some attention and turning it into a clean, refreshed home.</p><p>I love seeing the transformation and knowing that the work I do can make someone's life just a little bit easier.</p><p>Owning my own business also gives me flexibility to create a schedule that works with my family while still doing work I truly enjoy.</p></div>
      </section>

      <section class="best-part">
        <div class="best-part-copy"><p class="eyebrow">The Best Part</p><h2>My clients. <span>And their pets. 🐾</span></h2><p>There's nothing better than leaving a home knowing my client is happy with the work I've done. That feeling of accomplishment is one of the biggest reasons I love what I do.</p><p>And if you have pets, there's a pretty good chance I'll love them too! I'm an animal lover, so meeting my clients' furry family members is definitely one of the perks of the job.</p></div>
        <div class="pet-card"><div class="paw">🐾</div><h3>Pet-friendly homes are welcome.</h3><p>Your four-legged family members are part of the family too.</p></div>
      </section>

      <section class="values-section">
        <div class="section-heading centered"><p class="eyebrow">My Approach</p><h2>Your home is unique. Your cleaning should be too.</h2><p>I take the time to understand what matters most to you so your cleaning service feels personal, dependable, and right for your home.</p></div>
        <div class="values-grid"><article><span>💗</span><h3>Personal</h3><p>You'll know exactly who is caring for your home.</p></article><article><span>✨</span><h3>Detail-focused</h3><p>The little things matter, and I notice them.</p></article><article><span>🏡</span><h3>Customized</h3><p>Cleaning plans are shaped around your home's needs.</p></article><article><span>💚</span><h3>Dependable</h3><p>Clear expectations, consistent care, and no shortcuts.</p></article></div>
      </section>

      <section class="quote-box"><p>“I'm not just cleaning houses. I'm building relationships, one home at a time.”</p></section>

      <section class="about-cta"><p class="eyebrow">From Me to You</p><h2>Thank you for considering Cleaning by Cassi. 💗</h2><p>I truly appreciate every client who gives me the opportunity to do what I love. If you're ready for a little more breathing room at home, I'd love to hear from you.</p><a href="/quote" class="cta-button">Let's Talk About Your Home →</a><div class="signature">— {OWNER_NAME}</div></section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .about-page { overflow: hidden; }
  .about-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .9fr; align-items: center; gap: clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem); margin-bottom: 5rem; }
  .hero-copy h1 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .hero-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.85; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .8rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .primary-button,.secondary-button,.cta-button { display: inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:.95rem 1.45rem; border-radius:999px; font-weight:700; transition:.2s ease; }
  .primary-button { color:white; background:var(--brand-gradient); box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(111,20,217,.22); }
  .primary-button:hover { color:white; transform:translateY(-2px); }
  .secondary-button { color:var(--ink); border:1.5px solid var(--purple); background:var(--surface-solid); }

  .hero-photo-wrap { position:relative; aspect-ratio:4 / 3; }
  .hero-photo { width:100%; height:100%; min-height:430px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:32px; box-shadow:var(--shadow); }
  .photo-note { position:absolute; left:1rem; right:1rem; bottom:1rem; padding:.9rem 1rem; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface); box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(49,24,95,.12); font-weight:700; backdrop-filter:blur(10px); }

  .section-heading { max-width:760px; margin-bottom:2rem; }
  .section-heading h2 { margin-bottom:.7rem; }
  .section-heading > p:last-child { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; }
  .centered { margin-inline:auto; text-align:center; }

  .story-section { margin-bottom:4rem; }
  .story-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1rem; }
  .story-card { padding:1.5rem; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:22px; background:var(--surface-solid); box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(49,24,95,.08); }
  .story-number { color:var(--purple); font-weight:700; font-size:.8rem; letter-spacing:.1em; }
  .story-card p { margin-top:1rem; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.75; }
  .highlight-card { background:var(--brand-gradient-soft); }

  .split-section { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr; gap:3rem; margin:4rem 0; padding:clamp(1.7rem,5vw,3rem); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:28px; }
  .soft-green { background:linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(167,223,36,.14), rgba(21,72,245,.07)); }
  .copy-block p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; }

  .best-part { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:2rem; align-items:center; margin:4rem 0; }
  .best-part h2 span { display:block; color:var(--purple); }
  .best-part-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.85; }
  .pet-card { padding:2rem; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:28px; text-align:center; background:var(--brand-gradient-soft); box-shadow:var(--shadow); }
  .paw { font-size:3rem; }
  .pet-card p { color:var(--muted); }

  .values-section { margin:5rem 0; }
  .values-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:1rem; }
  .values-grid article { padding:1.4rem; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:20px; background:var(--surface-solid); box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(49,24,95,.08); }
  .values-grid article > span { font-size:1.7rem; }
  .values-grid h3 { margin-top:.7rem; }
  .values-grid p { color:var(--muted); font-size:.9rem; line-height:1.7; }

  .quote-box { margin:4rem auto; max-width:800px; padding:2rem; border-left:5px solid var(--pink); border-radius:0 24px 24px 0; background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(242,75,181,.12), rgba(111,20,217,.07)); }
  .quote-box p { margin:0; font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif; font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.2rem); font-style:italic; }

  .about-cta { padding:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem); border-radius:30px; text-align:center; color:white; background:var(--brand-gradient); }
  .about-cta .eyebrow,.about-cta h2,.about-cta p { color:white; }
  .about-cta p { max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 1.5rem; line-height:1.8; }
  .cta-button { background:white; color:var(--purple-dark); }
  .signature { margin-top:1.4rem; font-family:'DM Serif Display',serif; font-size:1.5rem; color:var(--green-bright); }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark) {
    .secondary-button { background:rgba(255,255,255,.04); border-color:#b78cff; }
    .photo-note { background:rgba(23,24,58,.9); }
  }

  @media (max-width:900px) {
    .about-hero,.split-section,.best-part { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .story-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .values-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
    .about-hero { margin-bottom:3.5rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width:560px) {
    .values-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .hero-photo-wrap { aspect-ratio:4 / 3; }
    .hero-photo { min-height:300px; }
    .hero-actions a { width:100%; }
    .photo-note { position:static; margin-top:.75rem; }
    .split-section,.pet-card,.quote-box { padding:1.35rem; }
  }
</style>